# Accounting and ledger

Canonical services/domains: `src/domain/ledger/`, `src/application/services/blackjack-round.ts`, `src/application/services/poker-hand.ts`, `src/application/services/tables.ts`, Prisma models under `prisma/`. Prefer those over inventing new money paths.

## Units and buckets

- Unit: millijetons (`bigint`, 1000 = 1 jeton). No floating-point balance math.
- AVAILABLE = `TableMember.availableMillis`
- LOCKED_BET = `BettingBox.lockedBetMillis`
- LOCKED_INSURANCE = `InsuranceBet.amountMillis` until settled
- LOCKED_POKER = `PokerParticipant.lockedMillis` until awarded
- Ordinary bets and Insurance are separate locked accounts and settle independently
- A round cannot complete while any box or Insurance stake remains unresolved

## Bank modes

- Open Bank: `BANK_VIRTUAL_RESERVE` is unlimited (not stored). Source of minted jetons / payout profit; sink of lost stakes.
- Limited Bank: table-specific `BANK_AVAILABLE` and `BANK_LOCKED_EXPOSURE`. Reserve max box profit before accepting stakes (1.5× for 3:2, 1.2× for 6:5). Insurance reserves 2× independently. Bank-side ledger legs never double-credit the Player.
- Open/Limited toggle is Bank/Owner menu only during unstaked BETTING; Players never see it.

## Blackjack payouts

- Win: profit 1× / return 2×
- Push: profit 0 / return 1×
- Loss: return 0
- Blackjack 3:2: profit 1.5× / return 2.5×
- Blackjack 6:5: profit 1.2× / return 2.2×
- Insurance 2:1: profit 2× / return 3× Insurance stake; never settled by ordinary box settlement (or vice versa)

## Poker pots

- Wagers move AVAILABLE → LOCKED_POKER only; never debit/credit `BANK_VIRTUAL_RESERVE`
- Side pots follow all-in contribution levels
- Split pots divide equally; millijeton remainder left of the dealer button
- Fold-out awards the complete pot once, including the winner’s committed blinds

## Commands and sessions

- Value-changing commands require an idempotency key and write ≥1 ledger entry in the same transaction
- Tables host sequential `GameSession` records (`SETUP | ACTIVE | COMPLETED | ABANDONED`)
- Closing a session writes `GAME_SESSION_CLOSE` (remaining AVAILABLE → 0); opening writes `GAME_SESSION_OPEN` for selected participants — fresh allocation, no leftover AVAILABLE across games
- First-table join uses `INITIAL_ALLOCATION` once per membership (`starting-jetons:{tableId}:{userId}`)

## Stake presentation

- `FUN_ONLY` (default): jetons only, no owe/owed
- `MONEY`: currency + rate (default USD 1:1) with optional buy-in; conversion is presentation-only
- `CUSTOM`: label + integer jetons per unit
- Do not represent Fun only as Money with a zero rate

## Personal ledger and wipe

- Verified players may save session nets to a personal Game Ledger (idempotent)
- Guests have no cross-table ledger
- Admin-only global `WIPE ALL TABLES` (`JETONBRO_ADMIN_EMAIL`, exact phrase): physically deletes **every** Table (all owners/statuses) after detaching ledger/session FKs; users and personal ledger history are retained
- There is no Owner `DELETE ALL MY TABLES` product path
- Normal CLOSE TABLE / END & DELETE hide or archive; they do not physically wipe ledger history unless explicitly authorised
